sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant Tel as Telephony (PSTN/SIP)
    participant Vapi as Vapi Orchestrator
    participant STT as Deepgram STT
    participant LLM as LLM (GPT-4o)
    participant Srv as Webhook API + Datastore
    participant TTS as ElevenLabs TTS

    Customer->>Tel: Answers call
    Tel->>Vapi: Audio stream
    Vapi->>STT: Stream audio (~200ms)
    STT-->>Vapi: Partial + final transcript

    rect rgb(240,240,240)
    note over Vapi,Srv: STATE: GREETING -> AUTH (no debt disclosed)
    Vapi->>LLM: Transcript + state + tool schemas (~400ms first token)
    LLM-->>Vapi: "Confirm last 4 digits of PAN or DOB"
    Vapi->>TTS: Synthesize (~300ms)
    TTS-->>Customer: Audio response
    Customer->>Vapi: "1234"
    Vapi->>LLM: Transcript "1234"
    LLM->>Srv: verify_customer(account_id, code)
    Srv-->>LLM: verified:true, name, account
    end

    rect rgb(222,245,222)
    note over Vapi,Srv: STATE: DISCLOSURE -> NEGOTIATION (gated on verified=true)
    LLM-->>Vapi: Disclose amount + DPD, ask for PTP
    Vapi->>TTS: Synthesize
    TTS-->>Customer: "₹8,499 overdue by 12 days..."
    Customer->>Vapi: "I'll pay Friday"
    LLM->>Srv: log_promise_to_pay(account_id, date, amount)
    Srv-->>LLM: ptp_id
    LLM->>Srv: send_payment_link(account_id, channel)
    Srv-->>LLM: link_sent:true
    end

    rect rgb(250,235,215)
    note over Vapi,Srv: STATE: WRAP_UP
    LLM->>Srv: mark_disposition(account_id, status, notes)
    Srv-->>LLM: logged:true
    end
    LLM-->>Vapi: Closing line
    Vapi->>Customer: End call
